 {r}←PolishClipboard dummy;cl;buff;flag;retry;counter
⍝ Special treatment for certain formats, for example when copying text from Notpad++ or Google Mail.
⍝ * Notepad++ assignes a nested vector to the "Text" property of the clipboard.
⍝   The first item contains all the text (⎕UCS 13 separated), the second one is empty.\\
⍝ In all these cases the contents of the clipboard is now converted into something useful.
 r←⍬
 cl←⎕NEW⊂'Clipboard'
 :If 0<≢cl.Text
     buff←{⍵↓⍨{-+/∧\0=⍵}⌽≢¨⍵}cl.Text
     :If (1=≢buff)∧2=≡buff
         buff←0⊃buff
         :If CR∊buff
             cl.Text←CR(≠⊆⊢)buff
         :EndIf
     :Else
         :If 1=≡buff
         :AndIf (⎕UCS 10)∊buff
             flag←counter←0
             retry←10
             :Repeat
                 :Trap 11
                     cl.Text←(⎕UCS 10)(≠⊆⊢)buff
                     flag←1
                 :Else
                     counter←counter+1
                     :If retry<counter
                         :Leave  ⍝ There is nothing we can do other than avoiding a crash
                     :EndIf
                     ⎕DL 0.01×counter
                 :EndTrap
             :Until flag
         :EndIf
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
⍝Done
